          ],
          "sub_type": "flowchart",
          "content": "```mermaid\ngraph TD\n  JAN[\"JAN\"] --> FEB[\"FEB\"]\n  JAN --> MAR[\"MAR\"]\n  FEB --> APR[\"APR\"]\n  MAR --> MAI[\"MAI\"]\n  MAR --> SEP[\"SEP\"]\n  MAR --> MAI\n  MAR --> OKT[\"OKT\"]\n  APR --> AUG[\"AUG\"]\n  AUG --> DEZ[\"DEZ\"]\n  MAI --> JUN[\"JUN\"]\n  JUN --> JUL[\"JUL\"]\n  OKT --> NOV[\"NOV\"]\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0257-0288/images/page_271_image_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.025,
            0.781,
            0.165,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "• **Übung**:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.068,
            0.849,
            0.868,
            0.957
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "– Welcher Baum ergibt sich bei umgekehrter Reihenfolge?\n– Wie kann man mittels Suchbäumen sortieren?"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.008,
            0.967,
            0.037,
            0.988
          ],
          "content": "272"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 272,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.024,
            0.025,
            0.385,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": "Einfügen eines Elementes"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.016,
            0.149,
            0.511,
            0.776
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```c\nbtreeptr insert(T* item, btreeptr b)\n{\n    btreeptr n;\n\n    if (b == NULL) {\n        n = (btreeptr)malloc(sizeof(btree));\n        n->data = item;\n        n->left = NULL; n->right = NULL;\n        return n;\n    }\n\n    if (key(item) < key(b->data))\n        b->left = insert(item,b->left);\n\n    if (key(item) > key(b->data))\n        b->right = insert(item,b->right);\n\n    return b;\n}\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.025,
            0.838,
            0.455,
            0.886
          ],
          "content": "• Beispiel: Einfügen von „DEZ“"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.523,
            0.175,
            0.987,
            0.752
          ],
          "sub_type": "flowchart",
          "content": "```mermaid\ngraph TD\n  JAN[\"JAN\"] --> FEB[\"FEB\"]\n  FEB --> APR[\"APR\"]\n  APR --> AUG[\"AUG\"]\n  AUG --> DEZ[\"DEZ\"]\n  MAR[\"MAR\"] --> MAI[\"MAI\"]\n  MAR --> SEP[\"SEP\"]\n  MAI --> JUN[\"JUN\"]\n  SEP --> OKT[\"OKT\"]\n  JUN --> JUL[\"JUL\"]\n  OKT --> NOV[\"NOV\"]\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0257-0288/images/page_272_image_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
